  "sourceTitle": "Fancy Cocktail",
  "sourceText": "Fancy Cocktail\nBy: Helen Pitlick\nPublished: Tuesday, February 23, 2010 - 1:32pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 1/2 ounces Encanto Acholado Pisco\n1/2 ounce Amontillado Sherry\n1/2 ounce Maraschino liqueur\n1 dash each orange & Angostura bitters\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Stir, strain, serve up with a lemon twist.\n\nAbout\n\n\nRecipe prepared by Neyah White and Duggan McDonell at Drinking Lessons at the Sorrento Hotel on Feb 21st and 22nd.",
